  "prefLabel": "Plc 402.06 Deficiency correction plan (DC plan)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 402.06 “Deficiency correction plan (DC plan)” means a written plan prepared by an applicant or licensee that identifies, for each deficiency that requires more than 14 days to be corrected, the following:\n\n(a) The deficiency and each corrective action required; and\n\n(b) The required date of completion.\n\nSource. #14031, eff 8-15-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc400.html"
